 "_note": "Shared boundary cases for the auth field rules (design 4.4, AUTH-AC10.7). The Flask schema tests and the frontend authRules tests both read this file. Each case starts from the form's base body, applies 'set' then 'drop', and expects either 'accepted' (fields whose normalized value is checked; the output keys must equal the form's key set) or the exact 'fields' map of messages. Values: {\"repeat\": s, \"times\": n} is s repeated n times; {\"concat\": [a, b]} joins parts. Lengths count Unicode code points.",
